# Assistant content: inline code. internal/tui/markdown.go's Code style
# colours the token (yellow) but glamour strips the surrounding backticks
# from the rendered text, so the source markup itself must not survive
# onto the screen.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-inline-code.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /limited\(count\)/ 20
SHOT reply
EXPECT /Call the limited\(count\) helper/
EXPECT_NOT /`/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
